name noconflict
category Package
revision 30140
shortdesc Resolve macro name conflict between packages
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides several commands to prefix (and hence
longdesc obscure) a macro's (or a sequence of macros') name, and to
longdesc restore the original macro(s) at places in a document where
longdesc they are needed.
runfiles size=1
